algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: Primes P = {p_1, ..., p_k}, scales {eps_1, ..., eps_m}
Output: Dimension estimate d_hat

for each eps_i:
    B = {floor(phi(p_j)/eps_i) : j = 1,...,k}
    N(eps_i) = |B|

Fit line: log N(eps) = d_hat * log(1/eps) + c
Return d_hat (slope of fitted line)

Time: O(k * m)
Space: O(k)
